[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3427.43, "timestamp": "00:57:07", "text": "しかし、来るだろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3429.349, "timestamp": "00:57:09", "text": "この場所にはたくさんの血がある、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3431.99, "timestamp": "00:57:11", "text": "道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3435.349, "timestamp": "00:57:15", "text": "私は間違っていたのだろうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3437.27, "timestamp": "00:57:17", "text": "大丈夫です。私たちはただこれらはただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3438.95, "timestamp": "00:57:18", "text": "行方不明者のように。まるで私がただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3441.589, "timestamp": "00:57:21", "text": "彼らが望むなら、全員踏み潰してやればいい。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3444.069, "timestamp": "00:57:24", "text": "ソファーを踏みつけて、そのうちの1人を叩く。大丈夫です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3446.63, "timestamp": "00:57:26", "text": "何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3450.63, "timestamp": "00:57:30", "text": "おお。ああ、あれを見て。拾った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3452.15, "timestamp": "00:57:32", "text": "鎧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3453.67, "timestamp": "00:57:33", "text": "ニース。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3455.99, "timestamp": "00:57:35", "text": "もう本当に何も運べない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3458.309, "timestamp": "00:57:38", "text": "待って、弾薬を拾ったのは君？それとも僕？私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3460.71, "timestamp": "00:57:40", "text": "でも、私にはそれができる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3463.43, "timestamp": "00:57:43", "text": "私にもその力はある。よし、それは良いことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3467.349, "timestamp": "00:57:47", "text": "ああ、あの不気味な顔。ええ、そうしました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3469.95, "timestamp": "00:57:49", "text": "はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3471.589, "timestamp": "00:57:51", "text": "うん。"}]